# eSSL Biometric Attendance Terminal
# Set ESSL_COMPORT to the Windows COM port the eSSL machine appears on
# (check Device Manager → Ports (COM & LPT) after plugging in the cable).
# On Linux/Mac the port looks like /dev/ttyUSB0 or /dev/cu.usbmodem*.
# When ESSL_COMPORT is set, the backend automatically polls the terminal
# and imports attendance into the Attendance section.
ESSL_COMPORT=""
ESSL_BAUD_RATE=9600
ESSL_POLL_INTERVAL_MS=30000
ESSL_USER=00000
ESSL_PASS=00